  <name>Highwater</name>
  <summary>Track AI provider quota limits</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Highwater shows how much of each AI provider rate-limit window has been used, when it
      resets, and whether the current pace will reach the limit.
    </p>
    <p>
      Compare configured providers in one native desktop window, inspect recent quota
      history, refresh readings from the tray, and receive warnings near a limit.
    </p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.kakadon000.Highwater.desktop</launchable>
